%%{init: {"theme": "base", "themeVariables": {"fontSize": "14px"}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Own as Policy owner
  participant Lib as Policy library
  participant Eng as Playbook engine
  participant PG as Policy Guard
  participant Ex as Executor
  participant Nt as Notification engine
  participant Au as Audit log
  Own->>Lib: set block time to 24 h and approve POL-001
  Note over Lib: only Approved policies take effect
  Eng->>Lib: playbook_context("web_bruteforce_response")
  Lib-->>Eng: policy.bruteforce_block_ttl_minutes = 1440
  Note over Eng,Lib: shown working in dry-run against the real engine,<br/>the live playbook still has to adopt policy.* values
  Eng->>PG: propose block_ip, ttl 1440 (needs gate G3)
  alt agent confidence below the G3 gate
    PG-->>Eng: rejected (limit for the gate)
    PG->>Au: rejection recorded
  else allowed
    PG->>Ex: action request
    Ex->>Ex: add acl, then verify (show acl)
    Ex->>Au: action and verification recorded
    Ex->>Nt: result
    Nt-->>Own: what was done, why, how to undo
  end
